Title: "Installation"
Id: "884025b0-0021-44d6-87b2-5715c5fe057c"

Text: "Build or install the `mlg` executable from the main MathLingua repository. During local development, the usual workflow is to build the Rust workspace and run the resulting binary from a collection directory.

After installation, verify that the command is available:

```text
mlg version
```

If the shell cannot find `mlg`, add the directory containing the executable to your `PATH` or run it by absolute path."
Id: "e8b12058-4136-4dd4-bb04-ef9127103092"
